{%- comment -%}
  Accordion boxes: tap a title to open or close it. Each box opens and closes on its own. Shown on phones only: hidden from 750px wide upwards (tablets and desktop).
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW. One box per entry, put @@ on its own line between boxes. In each box, the title comes first, then |||, then the text.
  The text can use <p>, <ul><li>, <strong>, <em> and <a href="...">. Do not use @@ or ||| inside the text.
  mb_open = number of the box that starts open (1, 2, 3 ...), or 0 to start with all boxes closed.
  mb_title_color / mb_text_color = title and text colours (locked, so the theme cannot turn them black). mb_border / mb_border_hover = box border colour and its colour when hovered.
  mb_open_bg = header background while a box is open. mb_focus_color = outline when a box is selected with the keyboard.
  mb_top / mb_bottom = space above and below the whole section. Every box also has 16px under it, like the original (merges with neighbouring blocks, never doubled).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_open = 0 -%}
{%- assign mb_title_color = '#121212' -%}
{%- assign mb_text_color = '#2b2b2b' -%}
{%- assign mb_border = '#ebebeb' -%}
{%- assign mb_border_hover = '#d1d1d1' -%}
{%- assign mb_open_bg = '#f5f5f5' -%}
{%- assign mb_focus_color = '#c47245' -%}
{%- assign mb_top = '0' -%}
{%- assign mb_bottom = '0' -%}
{%- capture mb_data -%}
